!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-template-named-bare-at-a-field-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10"
  description: """
    A template is not a type, so no position names one bare: `p: pet` is a resolver error at `holder`, though `pet`
    is abstract and states a selector. A family is declared with records: an abstract record states the selector,
    and a position names that record. A processor that reads a template named at a position as an abstract base
    dispatching over the declarations composing its applications accepts this schema.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
